    "description": "<p>You gain this state when you are reduced to 0 hit points and then fail a tenacity check. You don't take damage or regain hit points from states, and you also ignore minor environmental hazards, such as terrain damage.</p><p></p><p>While defeated, you do not roll initiative or take a turn in combat. If you regain hit points from a recovery, you lose this condition, and you can roll initiative and take a turn as normal in the following round.</p>",
